# Local production-like env
# Copy to `.env.local-prod` when you want docker compose local-prod to use
# a dedicated env file instead of `.env`.
#
# Recommended:
# - keep this file aligned with app-rem.remi.run auth behavior
# - use Clerk only here, not on localhost native dev
#
# Example:
# PORT=3000
# REMI_AUTH_MODE=clerk
# NEXT_PUBLIC_REMI_AUTH_MODE=clerk
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_xxx
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_xxx
# CLERK_JWT_KEY=-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----...
#
# Optionally inherit everything else from `.env` by copying it first:
#   cp .env .env.local-prod
# Then override only the production auth keys above.
